     A*  WMXCP - Client Control Master File                           *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  Description:                                                 *
     A*    This file will allow the client to specify security levels *
     A*    and DARTS Remark Type usage in various options and fields  *
     A*    throughout the PDS system.  This will allow the client the *
     A*    flexibility of changing these values, without requiring    *
     A*    programming intervention.                                  *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  10/22/97  C:33  Project:  60APC                              *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  REVISIONS:                                                   *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
